From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CEB-GNRD board layer <bmc@localhost>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dumps: offer BMC dump only

System dump needs host firmware support that this x86 board does not have.
Remove it from the dump type selection.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD board-specific policy]
---
 src/views/Logs/Dumps/DumpsForm.vue | 0
 1 file changed

--- a/src/views/Logs/Dumps/DumpsForm.vue
+++ b/src/views/Logs/Dumps/DumpsForm.vue
@@ -57,10 +57,6 @@
       selectedDumpType: null,
       dumpTypeOptions: [
         { value: 'bmc', text: i18n.global.t('pageDumps.dumpTypes.bmcDump') },
-        {
-          value: 'system',
-          text: i18n.global.t('pageDumps.dumpTypes.systemDump'),
-        },
       ],
     };
   },
